<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>十二经脉 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%8F%E8%84%89/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2026 09:42:51 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%8F%E8%84%89/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>经气本标篇第十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-15/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 10:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-15/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章详细列举了**十二经脉“气”的根本（本）与末梢（标）**的具体解剖位置，并提出了基于“气冲”理论的针刺禁忌。</description></item><item><title>经脉终始篇第十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-14/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 11:25:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-14/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>主要探讨了&lt;strong&gt;十二经脉的流注方向（终始）&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;阴阳气血的关系&lt;/strong&gt;以及&lt;strong&gt;脉气运行顺逆&lt;/strong&gt;的判断标准。</description></item><item><title>经脉相行篇第十三</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-13/</link><pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 10:20:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-13/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>此篇主要论述经脉的循行。黄帝鉴于原讲十二经之行有不够细致全面之处，有意借测验太子雷公，使之请教天师以便明确，是一篇微言奥旨。从而说明黄帝父子好学好问，为后世留遗产以利万民，诚不愧为圣帝！此篇细致精微的问答，可补《内经》之不足，而有助于中医经络之研究，以发挥其未知功能。</description></item><item><title>经水第十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-12/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 Aug 2025 15:25:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-12/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>本篇运用古代版图上清、渭、海、湖、汝、渑、淮、漯、江、河、济、漳十二条河流的大小、深浅、广狭、长短来比喻人体中十二经脉各自之不同的气血运行状况。因为本篇主要介绍了十二经和十二水的相互配合情况，并进而分述了手足阴阳各经最适当的进针深度和留针时间，所以篇名叫做&amp;quot;经水&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>经脉第十</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-10/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 12:40:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-10/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>本篇详述了十二经脉在全身的分布和循行情况，以及十五络脉的名称、循行路径及其虚实病候的表现。全篇内容，都着重在说明经脉具有决生死、处百病、调虚实的重要作用，所以篇名叫做&amp;quot;经脉&amp;quot;。</description></item></channel></rss>